rule LockoutTagoutRequired
	lineageTag: 11961a1f-c526-58bc-9dc3-ab8a13b56ae4
	statement: All maintenance work requires lockout/tagout before work starts. The tag must show the technician ID, date, time, and work order ID.

	ruleReferencedEntity maintenance#WorkOrder

	ruleReferencedEntity maintenance#Technician
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty technician_id

	ruleReferencedRelationship maintenance#WorkOrderAssignedTo
